{"id": "1702381", "name": "מכפלה והופכית של מטריצות מייצגות ומעבר בין ייצוגים של וקטור נתון במימד 2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span> מרחב וקטורי. יהיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B,C,D\\)</span> בסיסים למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span> ויהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> ב-V. נתון שמתקיים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[[v]_C={{CT:0}}, \\quad [I]^B_C={{CT:1}}, \\quad [I]^C_D={{CT:2}}\\]</p></div><p>מצאו את הבאים:</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([v]_D= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([v]_B= \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([I]^B_D= \\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> משתמשים בכלל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^B_C\\,[v]_B=[v]_C\\)</span> ובכך שמעברים מתחברים בכפל מטריצות: א׳ כפל, ב׳ כפל בהופכית, ג׳ מכפלת שתי מטריצות המעבר.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הכלל</b><br>מטריצת המעבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^B_C\\)</span> ממירה קואורדינטות לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> לקואורדינטות לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span>: לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\in V\\)</span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [I]^B_C\\,[v]_B=[v]_C \\]</p>ומעברים מתחברים בכפל: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^C_D\\,[I]^B_C=[I]^B_D\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סעיף א׳ — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([v]_D\\)</span></b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [v]_D=[I]^C_D\\,[v]_C={{CT:2}}{{CT:0}}={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — סעיף ב׳ — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([v]_B\\)</span></b><br>מהכלל, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^B_C\\,[v]_B=[v]_C\\)</span>. מטריצת מעבר הפיכה, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([v]_B=\\left([I]^B_C\\right)^{-1}[v]_C\\)</span>. למטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\times 2\\)</span> שהדטרמיננטה שלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(ad-bc\\)</span> שונה מאפס, ההופכית היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\begin{bmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{bmatrix}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{ad-bc}\\begin{bmatrix}d&-b\\\\-c&a\\end{bmatrix}\\)</span>. כאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det\\left([I]^B_C\\right)={{CT:4}},\\qquad \\left([I]^B_C\\right)^{-1}={{CT:5}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [v]_B={{CT:5}}{{CT:0}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p>בדיקה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [I]^B_C\\,[v]_B={{CT:1}}{{CT:6}}={{CT:7}}=[v]_C \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — סעיף ג׳ — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^B_D\\)</span></b><br>מעבר מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span> ואחריו מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span> ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> (המטריצה של המעבר הראשון מימין):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [I]^B_D=[I]^C_D\\,[I]^B_C={{CT:2}}{{CT:1}}={{CT:8}} \\]</p>בדיקה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^B_D\\,[v]_B={{CT:9}}=[v]_D\\)</span>, כמו בסעיף א׳.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "ta2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "ta3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": 